---
title: "Our Services | Full-Service Relocation | Chayce Properties"
description: "Chayce Properties' full-service relocation across the UK — packing, removals, downsizing and settling-in, for seniors and anyone planning a managed move."
bodyClass: "page-template page-loaded"
homeNav: false
activeKey: "services"
layout: base.njk
headExtra: |
  <style>
  .chayce-logo-link{text-decoration:none!important}
  /* ===== Hero (matches homepage home-hero language) ===== */
  .svc-hero{position:relative;min-height:520px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--ink) url(/images/chayce-services-hero.jpg) center 22%/cover no-repeat;overflow:hidden}
  .svc-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:
    linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(14,16,20,.92) 0%,rgba(14,16,20,.68) 45%,rgba(14,16,20,.38) 100%),
    linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(10,12,16,.5) 0%,rgba(10,12,16,0) 35%)}
  .svc-hero .container{position:relative;z-index:2;padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px}
  .svc-hero .breadcrumb{display:block;color:var(--gold-light);font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px}
  .svc-hero .breadcrumb a{color:#e8e6e0;text-decoration:none}
  .svc-hero h1{color:#fff;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:46px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:500;max-width:680px;margin:0 0 20px}
  .svc-hero h1 em{color:var(--gold-light);font-style:normal}
  .svc-hero p.lead{color:#e8e6e0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;max-width:560px;margin:0}
  /* ===== Shared section titles (reused from homepage) ===== */
  .home-section{padding:72px 0}
  .home-section.grey{background:var(--bg-warm)}
  .home-eyebrow{display:block;color:var(--gold-dark);font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px}
  .home-h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:34px;color:var(--ink);text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px}
  .home-h2 em{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal}
  .home-intro{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;color:#555;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}
  /* ===== Stage quick-nav (previews the three sections below) ===== */
  .stage-nav{display:flex;gap:0;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:980px;margin:52px auto 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-warm)}
  .stage-nav a{position:relative;flex:1 1 260px;background:transparent;border-left:2px solid var(--border-warm);padding:30px 28px 6px;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .2s ease}
  .stage-nav a:hover{border-left-color:var(--gold)}
  .stage-nav .badge{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold-dark);font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px}
  .stage-nav .label{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);display:block;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:500}
  .stage-nav h4{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.3}
  .stage-nav p{color:var(--grey-mid);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 18px}
  .stage-nav .go{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);transition:gap .2s ease,color .2s ease}
  .stage-nav a:hover .go{gap:10px;color:var(--gold)}
  .btn-lg{display:inline-block;padding:17px 36px;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;border-radius:2px;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;transition:.2s}
  .btn-lg.primary{background:var(--oxblood);color:#fff}
  .btn-lg.primary:hover{background:var(--oxblood-dark);color:#fff}
  /* ===== Editorial stage sections ===== */
  .stage-block{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:64px;padding:64px 0;scroll-margin-top:24px}
  .stage-block:nth-of-type(even){background:var(--bg-warm)}
  .stage-block .container{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:64px}
  .stage-block.reverse .container{flex-direction:row-reverse}
  .stage-media{flex:1 1 46%;position:sticky;top:110px}
  .stage-media img{width:100%;height:460px;object-fit:cover;display:block;box-shadow:0 24px 54px rgba(26,26,26,.16)}
  .stage-media .num-badge{position:absolute;top:22px;left:22px;background:rgba(18,18,20,.5);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);color:#fff;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;padding:9px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
  .stage-block.reverse .stage-media .num-badge{left:auto;right:22px}
  .stage-copy{flex:1 1 54%}
  .stage-copy h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:32px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 16px}
  .stage-copy h2 em{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal}
  .stage-copy > p.stage-intro{color:var(--grey-mid);font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 32px;max-width:520px}
  .stage-practice{background:var(--bg-cream);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding:20px 24px;margin:0 0 32px;max-width:520px}
  .stage-practice p{margin:0;font-size:16px;color:var(--slate);line-height:1.75}
  .stage-practice p strong{color:var(--ink);display:block;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:500}
  .svc-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-warm)}
  .svc-card{background:transparent;padding:30px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm)}
  .svc-card:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid var(--border-warm)}
  .svc-icon{flex:0 0 auto;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold-dark);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .svc-name{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 8px}
  .svc-desc{color:var(--grey-mid);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 14px}
  .svc-points{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:14px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);display:grid;gap:8px}
  .svc-points li{color:var(--grey-mid);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55}
  .svc-points li strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
  /* ===== Packages teaser ===== */
  .pkg-teaser{background:var(--bg-warm);padding:36px 0 40px}
  .pkg-teaser .container{max-width:760px}
  .pkg-teaser .panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(200,169,110,.35);padding:58px 56px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 26px 60px rgba(26,26,26,.08);position:relative}
  .pkg-teaser .panel::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:60px;height:3px;background:var(--gold)}
  .pkg-teaser .home-eyebrow{color:var(--gold-dark)}
  .pkg-teaser h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:30px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 14px}
  .pkg-teaser h2 em{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal}
  .pkg-teaser p{color:var(--grey-mid);font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 30px}
  .pkg-teaser a.explore{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:.2s}
  .pkg-teaser a.explore:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}
  /* ===== Final CTA (blends into the footer below instead of cutting off flat) ===== */
  .final-cta{position:relative;background:var(--ink) url(/images/chayce-cottage.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;padding:88px 0 96px;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
  .final-cta::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,22,29,.93) 0%,rgba(20,22,29,.87) 60%,var(--ink) 100%)}
  .final-cta .container{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .final-cta h3{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:32px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 12px}
  .final-cta p{color:#cfd0d4;font-size:16px;margin:0 auto 30px;max-width:520px}
  .final-cta .btn-row{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .final-cta .btn-lg.primary{background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink)}
  .final-cta .btn-lg.primary:hover{background:var(--gold-light);color:var(--ink)}
  .final-cta .cta-alt{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:16px;color:#9a9da5}
  .final-cta .cta-alt a{color:var(--gold-light);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
  .final-cta .cta-alt a:hover{color:#fff}
  .final-cta + .chayce-footer{padding-top:0}
  @media(max-width:991px){
    .stage-block .container{flex-direction:column}
    .stage-block.reverse .container{flex-direction:column}
    .stage-media img{height:320px}
    .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .svc-card:nth-child(odd){border-right:none}
  }
  @media(max-width:767px){
    .svc-hero{min-height:auto}
    .svc-hero h1{font-size:30px}
    .svc-hero p.lead{font-size:17px}
    .home-h2{font-size:27px}
    .home-section{padding:56px 0}
    .stage-nav{gap:18px;margin-top:36px;border-top:none}
    .stage-nav a{padding:22px 22px 6px}
    .stage-block{padding:56px 0}
    .stage-copy h2{font-size:26px}
    .stage-media img{height:240px}
    .svc-card{padding:22px 20px}
    .pkg-teaser{padding:56px 0}
    .pkg-teaser .panel{padding:40px 26px}
    .final-cta{padding:72px 0 64px}
    .final-cta h3{font-size:26px}
    .svc-icon{width:36px;height:36px;font-size:15px}
    .stage-media .num-badge{font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px}
    .pkg-teaser .panel{padding:44px 26px}
    .final-cta .btn-row{flex-direction:column;width:100%}
    .final-cta .btn-lg{width:100%;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box}
  }
  @media(max-width:480px){
    .svc-hero h1{font-size:25px}
    .home-h2{font-size:23px}
    .stage-copy h2{font-size:22px}
    .stage-nav a{flex:1 1 100%}
    .svc-name{font-size:17px}
    .pkg-teaser .panel{padding:34px 18px}
    .pkg-teaser h2{font-size:24px}
  }
  /* ===== Page FAQ ===== */
  .pg-faq-band{background:var(--bg-warm);padding:64px 0}
  .pg-faq-band .container{max-width:760px}
  .pg-faq-band h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:28px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 30px;text-align:center}
  .pg-faq{margin:0}
  .pg-faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm-2);padding:20px 0}
  .pg-faq details:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--border-warm-2)}
  .pg-faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
  .pg-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .pg-faq summary::after{content:'+';flex-shrink:0;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:400;color:var(--gold-dark)}
  .pg-faq details[open] summary::after{content:'\2212'}
  .pg-faq p{color:var(--grey-mid);font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:12px 0 0}

  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-nav.css">
footScripts: |
  <script src="/js/wp-includes_js_jquery_jquery.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/wp-includes_js_jquery_jquery-migrate.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/wp-content_themes_hompark_js_popper.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/wp-content_themes_hompark_js_bootstrap.min.js"></script>
---
<style>
.svc-hero{background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-services-hero.jpg" %});{% imageSet "chayce-services-hero.jpg" %}}
.final-cta{background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-cottage.jpg" %});{% imageSet "chayce-cottage.jpg" %}}
</style>
<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<header class="svc-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services</span>
    <h1>Support for <em>every step</em> of your move.</h1>
    <p class="lead">From preparing the home you&rsquo;re leaving to settling into the one you&rsquo;re moving to, Chayce plans, coordinates and carries out the work in between &mdash; so you&rsquo;re never managing it alone.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ INTRO ============ -->
<section class="home-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="home-eyebrow">What We Do</span>
    <h2 class="home-h2">What can <em>Chayce</em> actually do for you?</h2>
    <p class="home-intro">Every service we offer sits within one of three stages of your move &mdash; preparing, moving, and settling in. Our full-service relocation support is designed with senior clients in mind, but suits anyone who wants a fully-managed move. Explore each stage below, or open any service for more detail.</p>
    <div class="stage-nav">
      <a href="#stage-prepare">
        <span class="badge">01</span>
        <span class="label">Prepare</span>
        <h4>Getting your current home ready</h4>
        <p>Sorting, staging, agent liaison and legal coordination &mdash; so it's ready to sell.</p>
        <span class="go">Explore this stage &darr;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#stage-move">
        <span class="badge">02</span>
        <span class="label">Move</span>
        <h4>Handling moving day, start to finish</h4>
        <p>Packing, removals, cleaning and every account that needs transferring.</p>
        <span class="go">Explore this stage &darr;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#stage-settle">
        <span class="badge">03</span>
        <span class="label">Settle</span>
        <h4>Feeling at home, from day one</h4>
        <p>Unpacking, setup and ongoing concierge support once you're in.</p>
        <span class="go">Explore this stage &darr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STAGE 1: PREPARE ============ -->
<section class="stage-block" id="stage-prepare">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-media">
      <span class="num-badge">Stage 01 &middot; Prepare</span>
      {% image "chayce-gallery1.jpg", "A home prepared and staged by Chayce Properties" %}
    </div>
    <div class="stage-copy">
      <h2>Getting your <em>current home</em> ready</h2>
      <p class="stage-intro">Before any move can happen, your current home usually needs to be sorted, presented and sold. We take on the planning and the legwork &mdash; from clearing rooms to liaising with agents and solicitors &mdash; so it's ready when you are.</p>
      <div class="stage-practice"><p><strong>In practice</strong>This stage typically starts with a full room-by-room walkthrough to agree what's staying, what's being sold or donated, and what needs decluttering before an agent ever sees the property.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-grid">
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-boxes"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Home Sorting</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">A room-by-room sort of everything in your home &mdash; what to keep, donate, sell or let go of.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone facing a full house of belongings with no time or energy to face it alone.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> The sorting, categorising and organising, done patiently and at your pace.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-couch"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Property Staging</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Presenting your home at its best for viewings and listing photography.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone selling a property who wants the strongest possible sale price.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Furniture arrangement, styling touches and coordinating listing photography.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Estate Agent Liaison</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Ongoing communication with your estate agent throughout the sale.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone who'd rather not field agent calls and viewing requests themselves.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Viewing scheduling, negotiation updates and keeping the sale moving.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-signature"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Legal Coordination</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Coordination with your solicitor so paperwork and deadlines don't fall behind.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone who finds conveyancing timelines and correspondence overwhelming.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Chasing updates and keeping you informed at each milestone.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-car"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Chauffeur Viewings</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Private, chauffeured transport to and from property viewings.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone who finds getting to viewings tiring or difficult to arrange.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Booking the car, planning the route and accompanying you on the day.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-hammer"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Refurbishment</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Coordinated light repairs and decoration to present your home well.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone whose home needs a few finishing touches before it's ready to list.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Booking and overseeing trades, so you don't have to manage the work.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STAGE 2: MOVE ============ -->
<section class="stage-block reverse" id="stage-move">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-media">
      <span class="num-badge">Stage 02 &middot; Move</span>
      {% image "chayce-gallery2.jpg", "Packing and removals handled by Chayce Properties" %}
    </div>
    <div class="stage-copy">
      <h2>Handling <em>moving day</em>, start to finish</h2>
      <p class="stage-intro">Once a moving date is set, we take over the physical work &mdash; packing, removals, cleaning and every account that needs transferring &mdash; so the day itself is calm rather than chaotic.</p>
      <div class="stage-practice"><p><strong>In practice</strong>Your coordinator confirms utility transfer dates and cleaning bookings for both properties before the removal van is even booked, so nothing is arranged at the last minute.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-grid">
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-truck"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Packing &amp; Removals</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Full-service packing and insured removal of your belongings.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone who doesn't want to pack boxes or lift furniture themselves.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Packing materials, careful wrapping, loading and safe transport.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-broom"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Deep Cleaning</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">A thorough clean of the property you're leaving and the one you're moving into.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone handing back a property, or wanting a fresh start in a spotless new one.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Booking and overseeing the clean around your moving-day timeline.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Utility Transfers</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Transferring and redirecting your utilities, mail and key accounts.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone who doesn't want to spend moving week on hold with providers.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Contacting providers, setting transfer dates and confirming everything's switched over.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-warehouse"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Storage Solutions</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Secure, insured storage for belongings not moving straight into your new home.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone downsizing, or moving before their new home is fully ready.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Booking the storage and arranging collection or delivery when you need it.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STAGE 3: SETTLE ============ -->
<section class="stage-block" id="stage-settle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-media">
      <span class="num-badge">Stage 03 &middot; Settle</span>
      {% image "chayce-gallery3.jpg", "A new home settled and unpacked by Chayce Properties" %}
    </div>
    <div class="stage-copy">
      <h2>Feeling at home, <em>from day one</em></h2>
      <p class="stage-intro">Arriving isn't the finish line. We unpack, place your furniture and stay on hand afterwards, so your new home feels like yours straight away &mdash; not weeks later.</p>
      <div class="stage-practice"><p><strong>In practice</strong>Furniture is placed and boxes unpacked room by room on the day itself, with packaging cleared as we go &mdash; the goal is a livable home by evening, not a stack of boxes to work through over the following weeks.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-grid">
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-chair"></i></span>
          <h4 class="svc-name">Furniture Placement</h4>
          <p class="svc-desc">Assembly and arrangement of your furniture in your new rooms.</p>
          <ul class="svc-points">
            <li><strong>Who it helps:</strong> Anyone who doesn't want to be assembling furniture on moving day.</li>
            <li><strong>Chayce handles:</strong> Assembly, positioning and adjustments until each room is arranged as you want it.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
